trait-social-anxiety-name = Social Anxiety
trait-social-anxiety-desc = Talking to people is very stressful for you. You stutter and use filler words when talking around crowds, and eye contact makes you nervous.

social-anxiety-fidget = {$examiner} makes eye contact with you, causing you to start fidgeting nervously!
social-anxiety-stutter = {$examiner} makes eye contact with you, causing you to start stuttering!
social-anxiety-freeze = {$examiner} stares directly at you, causing you to freeze up in panic!
social-anxiety-record-text = Patient suffers from acute social anxiety, manifest through crowd-induced stuttering and panic reactions during direct eye contact.
